要展示 `remote_ratio` 与 `employment_type` 的相关性，可以使用一个热图来帮助识别两者之间的关系。以下是使用 Vega-Lite 编写的代码示例：

```json
{
  "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega-lite/v5.json",
  "data": {
    "values": [
      {"work_year": 2020, "experience_level": "MI", "employment_type": "FT", "job_title": "Data Scientist", "salary": 70000, "salary_currency": "EUR", "salary_in_usd": 79833, "employee_residence": "DE", "remote_ratio": 0, "company_location": "DE", "company_size": "L"},
      {"work_year": 2020, "experience_level": "SE", "employment_type": "FT", "job_title": "Machine Learning Scientist", "salary": 260000, "salary_currency": "USD", "salary_in_usd": 260000, "employee_residence": "JP", "remote_ratio": 0, "company_location": "JP", "company_size": "S"},
      {"work_year": 2020, "experience_level": "SE", "employment_type": "FT", "job_title": "Big Data Engineer", "salary": 85000, "salary_currency": "GBP", "salary_in_usd": 109024, "employee_residence": "GB", "remote_ratio": 50, "company_location": "GB", "company_size": "M"},
      {"work_year": 2020, "experience_level": "MI", "employment_type": "FT", "job_title": "Product Data Analyst", "salary": 20000, "salary_currency": "USD", "salary_in_usd": 20000, "employee_residence": "HN", "remote_ratio": 0, "company_location": "HN", "company_size": "S"},
      {"work_year": 2020, "experience_level": "SE", "employment_type": "FT", "job_title": "Machine Learning Engineer", "salary": 150000, "salary_currency": "USD", "salary_in_usd": 150000, "employee_residence": "US", "remote_ratio": 50, "company_location": "US", "company_size": "L"},
      {"work_year": 2020, "experience_level": "EN", "employment_type": "FT", "job_title": "Data Analyst", "salary": 72000, "salary_currency": "USD", "salary_in_usd": 72000, "employee_residence": "US", "remote_ratio": 100, "company_location": "US", "company_size": "L"}
      // ... (其他数据行)
    ]
  },
  "mark": "rect",
  "encoding": {
    "x": {
      "field": "remote_ratio",
      "type": "ordinal",
      "title": "Remote Ratio"
    },
    "y": {
      "field": "employment_type",
      "type": "ordinal",
      "title": "Employment Type"
    },
    "color": {
      "aggregate": "count",
      "type": "quantitative",
      "title": "Count"
    },
    "tooltip": [
      {"field": "remote_ratio", "title": "Remote Ratio"},
      {"field": "employment_type", "title": "Employment Type"},
      {"aggregate": "count", "title": "Count"}
    ]
  },
  "config": {
    "view": {"stroke": "transparent"},
    "axis": {"grid": true}
  }
}
```

### 解释
- **数据**：使用 `values` 字段直接嵌入数据。你可以替换或添加更多数据行。
- **标记**：使用 `rect` 来创建热图。
- **x 和 y 轴**：分别映射到 `remote_ratio` 和 `employment_type`。
- **颜色编码**：使用 `count` 聚合来计算每个组合的出现次数。
- **工具提示**：显示当前方块的 `remote_ratio`、`employment_type` 和计数。

这个可视化会帮助你观察不同远程工作比例与雇佣类型的分布情况。

要使用上述 Vega-Lite 代码生成图像，您可以通过以下步骤来实现：

1. **安装和设置环境**：
   - 确保您有一个支持 JavaScript 的环境，例如浏览器或 Node.js。
   - 如果在浏览器中使用，您可以在 HTML 文件中嵌入 Vega-Lite，使用 `<script>` 标签引入 Vega-Lite 的库。

2. **引入 Vega-Lite 库**：
   - 在 HTML 文件中，使用以下代码引入 Vega-Lite 和 Vega-Embed 库：
     ```html
     <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/vega@5"></script>
     <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/vega-lite@5"></script>
     <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/vega-embed@6"></script>
     ```

3. **创建一个容器来显示图像**：
   - 在 HTML 文件中，添加一个用于显示图像的 `<div>` 标签：
     ```html
     <div id="vis"></div>
     ```

4. **嵌入 Vega-Lite 代码**：
   - 使用 JavaScript 在您的 HTML 文件中嵌入 Vega-Lite 代码：
     ```html
     <script type="text/javascript">
       var spec = {
         "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega-lite/v5.json",
         "data": {"url": "/ds_salaries.csv"},
         "transform": [
           {
             "aggregate": [
               {"op": "mean", "field": "salary_in_usd", "as": "avg_salary"}
             ],
             "groupby": ["experience_level", "company_size"]
           }
         ],
         "mark": "rect",
         "encoding": {
           "x": {
             "field": "experience_level",
             "type": "ordinal",
             "title": "经验等级",
             "sort": ["EN", "MI", "SE", "EX"]
           },
           "y": {
             "field": "company_size",
             "type": "ordinal",
             "title": "公司规模",
             "sort": ["S", "M", "L"]
           },
           "color": {
             "field": "avg_salary",
             "type": "quantitative",
             "title": "平均薪资 (USD)",
             "scale": {"scheme": "redyellowgreen"}
           },
           "tooltip": [
             {"field": "experience_level", "title": "经验等级"},
             {"field": "company_size", "title": "公司规模"},
             {"field": "avg_salary", "title": "平均薪资", "format": ",.0f"}
           ]
         },
         "config": {
           "view": {"stroke": "transparent"},
           "axis": {"grid": true}
         }
       };

       vegaEmbed('#vis', spec).then(result => {
         console.log('Visualization rendered successfully!');
       }).catch(error => {
         console.error('Error rendering visualization:', error);
       });
     </script>
     ```

5. **确保数据文件可访问**：
   - 确保 `ds_salaries.csv` 文件在您的服务器上可访问，并且路径正确。

通过这些步骤，您可以在网页上渲染 Vega-Lite 图像。如果您使用的是 Node.js 或其他环境，您可能需要调整路径和环境设置。
